Let a member turn on the default features its workspace dependency turns off

Cargo enables a dependency's default features when a member inheriting it
from workspace.dependencies sets default-features = true, even where the
workspace entry sets it false. Resolution here kept only the workspace
entry's setting, so such a member was built without the features it asks
for.

License: Apache-2.0 (rules_rs 0.0.112)

--- a/rs/private/cargo_workspace_graph.bzl
+++ b/rs/private/cargo_workspace_graph.bzl
@@ -151,6 +151,9 @@
         if spec.get("optional"):
             inherited["optional"] = True
 
+        if spec.get("default_features", spec.get("default-features")):
+            inherited["default_features"] = True
+
         if spec.get("package"):
             inherited["package"] = spec["package"]
 
